# Stage A — Gate 0 + --max-num-seqs 128 + --max-num-active-seqs 88.
# Decisive probe: cap RUNNING without shrinking CUDA-graph / runner capacity.
# Burned: --max-num-seqs 64 alone → Final S=0 (TTFT 6.54s). Keep runner at 128.
# Parent: final-combined #11 S=21.0. MTP off. Budget 2048. Cold Final only.
# Success: p95 TPOT → 50ms while p95 TTFT stays inside input-length SLO.
CMKL/MANGO1.5-Qwen3.5-9B-AWQ-W4A16-mtp
--host 0.0.0.0
--port 8000
--served-model-name mango1.5-awq-w4a16
--trust-remote-code
--gpu-memory-utilization 0.95
--max-model-len 40960
--enable-auto-tool-choice
--tool-call-parser qwen3_coder
--reasoning-parser qwen3
--enable-chunked-prefill
--max-num-batched-tokens 2048
--max-num-seqs 128
--max-num-active-seqs 88
--enable-prefix-caching
# --mamba-cache-mode align matches run5/profile.args.
# On vLLM 0.32.1rc1.dev361+g83c078d95, --mamba-cache-mode is deprecated and has no effect.
# Mamba prefix caching follows --enable-prefix-caching.
# flag-check may WARN that "align" is absent from that deprecation text. That WARN is expected.
--mamba-cache-mode align
